#: ../../wasm-engine.rst:34
msgid ""
"The daemon embeds the module. Its build script (``cmd/sibuna/build.rs``) "
"runs a nested ``cargo rustc -p sibuna-pow-wasm --target "
"wasm32-unknown-unknown --profile wasm`` into the workspace's target "
"directory (``target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/wasm/``). The nested build "
"locks only the ``wasm`` profile's directories, so it never waits on the "
"outer build. The final link gets ``--compress-relocations``. The script "
"checks that the result starts with the WebAssembly magic bytes, and "
"copies it to the build output directory. ``SIBUNA_POW_WASM=<path>`` "
"embeds a prebuilt module instead, for builds without the WebAssembly "
"target. The daemon then includes the bytes in its binary:"
msgstr ""
"El daemon integra el módulo. Su script de compilación "
"(``cmd/sibuna/build.rs``) ejecuta un ``cargo rustc -p sibuna-pow-wasm "
"--target wasm32-unknown-unknown --profile wasm`` anidado en el directorio "
"de destino del workspace (``target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/wasm/``). La "
"compilación anidada solo bloquea los directorios del perfil ``wasm``, así "
"que nunca espera a la compilación externa. El enlazado final recibe "
"``--compress-relocations``. El script comprueba que el resultado empieza "
"por los bytes mágicos de WebAssembly y lo copia al directorio de salida "
"de la compilación. ``SIBUNA_POW_WASM=<path>`` integra en su lugar un "
"módulo precompilado, para compilaciones sin el destino WebAssembly. "
"Después, el daemon incluye los bytes en su binario:"

#: ../../wasm-engine.rst:36
msgid ""
"/// The browser solver, built by `build.rs` from `cmd/sibuna-pow-wasm`.\n"
"pub const WASM_SOLVER: &[u8] =\n"
"    include_bytes!(concat!(env!(\"OUT_DIR\"), \"/sibuna-pow.wasm\"));\n"
"/// The solver's Web Worker.\n"
"pub const WORKER_JS: &str = include_str!(\"../../../web/worker.js\");"
msgstr ""
"/// El solucionador del navegador, compilado por `build.rs` desde\n"
"/// `cmd/sibuna-pow-wasm`.\n"
"pub const WASM_SOLVER: &[u8] =\n"
"    include_bytes!(concat!(env!(\"OUT_DIR\"), \"/sibuna-pow.wasm\"));\n"
"/// El Web Worker del solucionador.\n"
"pub const WORKER_JS: &str = include_str!(\"../../../web/worker.js\");"

#: ../../wasm-engine.rst:44
msgid ""
"There is no second implementation to drift. The module is served from the "
"daemon at ``/__sibuna/wasm/sibuna-pow.wasm`` with a one-hour cache header "
"(``Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600``). Built with the profile above, "
"the module measures 14,744 bytes with both tiers (``wasm_bytes`` in "
"``benchmarks/results/primitives-latest.json``)."
msgstr ""
"No hay una segunda implementación que pueda divergir. El daemon sirve el "
"módulo en ``/__sibuna/wasm/sibuna-pow.wasm`` con una cabecera de caché de "
"una hora (``Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600``). Compilado con el "
"perfil anterior, el módulo ocupa 14.744 bytes con ambos niveles "
"(``wasm_bytes`` en ``benchmarks/results/primitives-latest.json``)."

